### 1.2 Request Flow – Login

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as LoginPage
    participant S as /api/auth/login
    participant BG as botGuard
    participant JC as jurisdictionControl
    participant DB as Database
    participant RM as RememberMe
    participant GD as GriftDetection
    participant LR as legalReaccept

    C->>S: POST {email, password, rememberMe}
    S->>BG: botGuard(req, "LOGIN")
    BG-->>S: {allowed, score, signals}
    S->>DB: storage.verifyUser(email, password)
    DB-->>S: user | null
    Note over S: Check isDeleted, isDisabled, isFrozen
    S->>JC: evaluateLoginJurisdiction(ip, user country)
    JC-->>S: {allowed} | {blocked, reason}
    S->>DB: persistBotAssessment
    S->>S: session.regenerate()
    S->>DB: createUserSession(...)
    S->>GD: onLoginSuccess + maybeApplyAutoEnforcement
    GD-->>S: enforcement result
    S->>DB: query userVerification (email verified?)
    Note over S: Compute grace period
    S->>LR: computeDoc1ReacceptStatus(userId)
    LR-->>S: {required, blocked, sha256s}
    S->>LR: upsertDoc1ReacceptRequirement("LOGIN")
    opt rememberMe === true
        S->>RM: issueRememberMeToken + enforceDeviceLimit
        S->>C: Set-Cookie: remember-me
    end
    S->>C: 200 {user, emailVerified, legalReaccept...}
```

### 1.3 Request Flow – Registration

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as LoginPage
    participant S as /api/auth/register
    participant JC as jurisdictionControl
    participant BG as botGuard
    participant CAP as captcha
    participant COV as coverageGate
    participant TK as cryptoUtils
    participant ACC as legalAcceptance
    participant DB as Database

    C->>S: POST {email, username, password, countryIso2, termsToken, combinedSha256, phone}
    Note over S: Check signupsFrozen → log to signupFreezeAttempts
    S->>S: Zod validation
    S->>JC: evaluateSignupJurisdiction(ip, selected)
    JC-->>S: allowed | blocked
    S->>BG: botGuard(req, "SIGNUP")
    BG-->>S: {allowed, score}
    S->>CAP: Slider or Turnstile/hCaptcha verify
    S->>COV: checkCoverage(countryIso2)
    COV-->>S: {allowed, enforced, reason}
    S->>TK: verifyDoc1TermsToken(termsToken)
    TK-->>S: {ok, payload} with SHA verification
    S->>DB: storage.getUserByEmail (uniqueness)
    S->>S: normalizeSignupPhone(phone, country)
    S->>DB: storage.createUser(...)
    S->>ACC: recordDoc1Acceptance(...)
    Note over S: ⚠️ FAIL-CLOSED: rollback user if acceptance fails
    S->>DB: initialize userVerification
    S->>DB: Insert emailVerificationTokens + send email
    S->>S: session.regenerate()
    S->>DB: createUserSession(...)
    S->>C: 201 {user, emailVerified: false, inGracePeriod: true}
```

